## ✅ Neon Orchard — Completed

**Summary:** Built a small self-contained playable browser game at `neon-orchard/index.html`. Player slides a neon-rim basket with **Arrow Keys / A/D**, **mouse/touch drag**, and **◀▶ mobile buttons** to catch glowing fruit (**+10**, combo tiered **+15 at x3**, **+20 at x5** with punch/pop/ring juice, persistent pile, and bouncy +points xCombo! text) while dodging falling rocks (**-1 heart**, shake + buzz + red flash). Includes **score**, **3 lives (♥)**, **increasing difficulty** (spawn 820→260ms, fall speed 1→2.6×, rock rate 22%→40%, double-spawn), **Start → Pause (P/Space) → Game Over → Restart** flow with **best score via localStorage**, polished responsive neon orchard visuals (gradient + canopy + string lights + glow + particles), Web Audio tones, and full keyboard/touch support. Zero external deps, single 993-line HTML file.

**Public game link:** https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/c3a4c5050b866aa5569bc526669745ebf994c5cf/neon-orchard/index.html  
Local (this run): `http://localhost:3000/neon-orchard/` (tmux `app-server`, `python3 -m http.server 3000`)

**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/c3a4c5050b866aa5569bc526669745ebf994c5cf

**Deployment & test status:**
- App server: ✅ running in tmux session `app-server` on port 3000 (PID python3 http.server, `curl http://localhost:3000/neon-orchard/ → 200`)
- Browser tests: ✅ **ALL 9 checks PASSED** via Playwright Chromium (title, score 0, 3 hearts, start overlay, start flow, ArrowRight move, gameplay wait, pause/resume, mobile controls 390×844, game-over overlay) — see `/tmp/test-neon.js`
